{"2820910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Vortex Revenants", "steam_appid": 2820910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a heart-pounding adventure in our upcoming game, heavily inspired by the legendary Enemy Territory: Quake Wars but carving its unique path in the gaming universe. Get ready for an unparalleled experience with these standout features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Class System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the familiar class-switching dynamics from ETQW, adding layers of strategy and excitement to each online team battle. Adapt on the fly for truly dynamic gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlockable Characters and Skills:  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer cooperative missions to unlock new characters and skills, tailoring your online team gameplay to your style. Your journey, your choices!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dual-front Warfare</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in the ultimate online team battle, seamlessly transitioning between heart-pounding infantry combat and adrenaline-pumping vehicular warfare. Two fronts, one epic confrontation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cosmetics and Achievements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a dedicated online team player or seeking a shortcut, earn a plethora of achievements through skill and strategy. Unlock stunning cosmetics by playing or fast-track your collection for a nominal fee.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long-Term Features on the Horizon:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Clan Wars</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rally your online team forces! Immerse yourself in a dedicated system for clan warfare, where alliances clash for supremacy. Will your online team reign supreme?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Galactic Warfare</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your horizons and conquer multiple planets and solar systems. Each celestial battlefield boasts its own rules and challenges, from varying gravity to unique environmental twists.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a heart-pounding adventure in our upcoming game, heavily inspired by the legendary Enemy Territory: Quake Wars but carving its unique path in the gaming universe. Get ready for an unparalleled experience with these standout features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Class System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the familiar class-switching dynamics from ETQW, adding layers of strategy and excitement to each online team battle. Adapt on the fly for truly dynamic gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlockable Characters and Skills:  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer cooperative missions to unlock new characters and skills, tailoring your online team gameplay to your style. Your journey, your choices!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dual-front Warfare</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in the ultimate online team battle, seamlessly transitioning between heart-pounding infantry combat and adrenaline-pumping vehicular warfare. Two fronts, one epic confrontation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cosmetics and Achievements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a dedicated online team player or seeking a shortcut, earn a plethora of achievements through skill and strategy. Unlock stunning cosmetics by playing or fast-track your collection for a nominal fee.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long-Term Features on the Horizon:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Clan Wars</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rally your online team forces! Immerse yourself in a dedicated system for clan warfare, where alliances clash for supremacy. Will your online team reign supreme?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Galactic Warfare</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your horizons and conquer multiple planets and solar systems. Each celestial battlefield boasts its own rules and challenges, from varying gravity to unique environmental twists.</p>", "short_description": "Vortex Revenants: Immerse yourself in intense team-based FPS battles set in a futuristic world. Choose your class, wield advanced weaponry, and dominate the competition in dynamic environments.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820910/header.jpg?t=1754343324", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820910/59536861544ed8c3029e4b93e0bf2ac02494c905/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754343324", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820910/59536861544ed8c3029e4b93e0bf2ac02494c905/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754343324", "website": "https://vortexrevenants.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Flint Forge"], "publishers": ["Flint Forge"], "package